= T.V. Soong

Scion of the prominent Soong family and eldest son of patriarch Charlie Soong, T.V. Soong attended university in the United States before becoming first a businessman and then ably serving Sun Yat-sen in China's financial circles. He carries close ties to China's top financial and industrial institutions, but has become increasingly wary of the Communist's growing power.

